{"step_index":8157,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-24T17:43:30Z","thinking":"The code declares a grounding feature, but it's not actually used within the relevant functions. This suggests a potential unimplemented feature or a missing integration point. Investigating Google AI Studio, the UI indicates that grounding with Google Search is an available feature, configurable within the \"Run settings.\" This confirms that grounding capability is intended for the system's operation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Inspect Google AI Studio DOM for Google Search / Grounding toggle and Tools","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import asyncio\nfrom playwright.async_api import async_playwright\n\nCHROME_PROFILE_DIR = r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio\\chrome_profile\"\n\nasync def main():\n    async with async_playwright() as p:\n        context = await p.chromium.launch_persistent_context(\n            user_data_dir=CHROME_PROFILE_DIR,\n            headless=True,\n            args=[\"--disable-blink-features=AutomationControlled\"]\n        )\n        page = context.pages[0] if context.pages else await context.new_page()\n        await page.goto(\"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat\", wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\", timeout=60000)\n        await asyncio.sleep(4)\n        \n        info = await page.evaluate('''() => {\n            const elements = [];\n            // Look for toggles, checkboxes, slide-toggles, buttons\n            const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('mat-slide-toggle, mat-checkbox, button, [role=\"switch\"], .tool-item, ms-tool-toggle, mat-expansion-panel');\n            nodes.forEach(n => {\n                const text = (n.innerText || n.textContent || '').trim().replace(/\\\\s+/g, ' ');\n                const aria = n.getAttribute('aria-label') || '';\n                const checked = n.getAttribute('aria-checked') || n.classList.contains('mat-mdc-slide-toggle-checked') || n.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked;\n                if (/search|ground|tool|function|code/i.test(text + ' ' + aria)) {\n                    elements.push({\n                        tag: n.tagName,\n                        className: n.className,\n                        text: text.slice(0, 100),\n                        ariaLabel: aria,\n                        checked: checked,\n                        id: n.id\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n            return elements;\n        }''')\n        \n        print(\"Found Search/Tool elements:\")\n        for idx, item in enumerate(info):\n            print(f\"[{idx}] Tag: {item['tag']} | Checked: {item['checked']} | Aria: '{item['ariaLabel']}' | Text: '{item['text']}'\")\n\n        # Also take screenshot\n        await page.screenshot(path=\"scratch_studio_tools.png\")\n        await context.close()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n","Description":"Inspect Google AI Studio DOM for Google Search / Grounding toggle and tools","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\inspect_tools_dom.py","toolAction":"Writing inspect_tools_dom.py","toolSummary":"Script to inspect tools and search toggle in Google AI Studio"}}]}
